===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*koira}}, from earlier {{m|urj-pro||*koj(e)ra}}, from {{inh|fi|urj-pro|*kojera|t=male animal}} (whence also {{m|fi|koiras|t=male animal}}), derived from {{der|fi|urj-pro|*koje||male, man|id=male}},<ref>{{R:fi:EVE|koira|accessdate=2024-01-01}}</ref> in which case the word probably originally meant "male dog" specifically (and possibly displaced {{m|fi|peni}} in the general sense of "dog").

